[statement]
Observed; the rule is not yet known. `So` is reached before `Pc`, and `jack`
is its best candidate, yet apk installs `pjack` for it: `pjackdev`, the best
candidate for `Pc`, needs `pjack`, which provides `So` at a lower version.
Contrast `...-not-when-a-name-between-takes-what-it-needs`. Reduced from
Alpine (`reduced/mpv-dev-takes-pipewire-jack`).

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:libs Pc

P:libs
V:1
D:So

P:jack
V:1.9
p:So=0.999

P:jackdev
V:1.9
p:Pc=1.9

P:pjack
V:1.6
p:So=0.3

P:pjackdev
V:1.6
D:pjack
p:Pc=3.1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install pjack 1.6
install libs 1
install pjackdev 1.6
install top 1
